export anchor DarkSwissStyle:
    number: 250
    screen: DesignEditor
    name: Dark Swiss
    idea: A strict twelve column grid on black set in one grotesque, with flush left numbered lists, heavy top rules and a single signal red that marks only what is active.
    base: dark
    palette:
        black: #0a0a0a, the page and panels
        column: #161616, the canvas stage
        ink: #f5f5f5, text and heavy rules
        grey: #a6a6a6, labels and list numbers
        rule: #3d3d3d, hairlines between rows
        signalRed: #ff3d2e, the active tool, the selected layer, frame selection, Share under black text and focus
    type:
        One stack, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, Liberation Sans. Body
        14px at 1.4. The file title is 64px 700 at 0.92 line height and
        minus 0.035em tracking, status figures 36px 700, names and tools
        15px 700, labels 11px 700 tracked 0.04em in grey, and the sheet
        title 44px.
    layout:
        Everything sits on a twelve column grid with 24px gutters and 32px
        margins. The masthead under a 1px ink rule has a small path label
        over a huge Home v3 with a grey dash Hero across seven columns, and
        the initials with full names, Present and a red Share across five.
        The tool row lists 01 Move to 06 Hand as numbered words, Move red
        with a 3px red underline, and Zoom 66% set large at the right. The
        work row gives the layers three columns, the canvas six and the
        inspector three, each headed by a 3px ink rule and a small grey
        label. Layers are a numbered index with names over type words,
        children indented by a hairline, Hero red with a red square and
        Selected. The canvas stage shows faint red column guides behind the
        white frame with small square red handles. The inspector is a
        typographic table grouped under Frame, Auto layout and Export.
        Status runs as three grid thirds, each a small label and a large
        figure, Saved 2 minutes ago, 3 people editing and Version 41.
        Below 1100px the inspector moves under the canvas. Below 760px a
        four column grid, the canvas alone and a three by two grid of
        numbered tools.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 24px gutters, 32px margins, 8px list row padding.
    density: Medium. Layers three columns, canvas six and inspector three.
    corners: Square everywhere. Avatars are initials only.
    borders: A 3px ink rule over each section, 1px ink under the masthead and table groups, 1px #3d3d3d hairlines between rows.
    shadows: None. The canvas shows faint red column guides instead.
    icons:
        16px line icons at 2px stroke with butt caps, used sparingly at row
        ends. Saved uses a check circle in red, editing two people and the
        version a tag, each beside its label.
    focus: A 2px red outline offset 2px, and a 3px red underline on fields.
    tone: Numbered and factual, such as 01 Move and Inspector, Hero.
